      "content": "rest doesn't really fix the fact that there's no point to any of it. i look at the path behind me and it was all just for this moment, and now that it's over, i'm just... done. it feels like i've completed my purpose and there's nothing left to do but fade out. i don't see why i should have to keep struggling and reinventing myself just to keep existing.",
